        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "MAT.12.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Mateo 12:42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LUK.11.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Luka 11:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo namfumu wa ku Sheba aumfwile ululumbi lwa pali Solomoni, aishile ku Yerusalemu kukwisa mwesha mu mepusho ayakosa nganshi. Afika no mulongo ukalamba uwa babomfi ne ngamila ishasendele ifya cena cisuma, golide uwingi nganshi elyo no tumabwe utwauma umutengo. Ilyo afika kuli Solomoni atendeka ukulanda nankwe pa fintu fyonse ifyali mu mano yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni nao ayasukafye amepusho yakwe yonse. Tapali icamucushishe pakumulondolwela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo namfumu wa ku Sheba amwene amano yali muli Solomoni, pamo pene ne sano lintu akuulile, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "icakulya icali petebulo lyakwe, ifyo bacilolo bakwe baikele, imitumikile ya babomfi elyo nefyo bafwele, bakatumika ba lukombo lwa mfumu mu fyakufwala fyabo elyo na malambo yakoca ayo apeele pa ŋanda yakwa Yawe, ena camupesha amano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo aeba imfumu Solomoni ati, “Akasebo naumfwile ilyo ncili mu calo candi pafyo wabomba elyo na pa mano yobe kanshi fyacine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo nshasumine ifyo balelanda mpakafye naisa imwena na menso yandi. Kabili mona ifyo balondolwele kuli ine tafyafikile na pali citika wa bwingi bwa mano yobe. Iwe walicila pa lulumbi naumfwile.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Yangu ifyo bashuka abaume bobe! Yangu ifyo bashuka bacilolo bobe, abeminina pantanshi yobe cila nshita mukumfwa amano yobe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napaalwe na matotelo Yawe Lesa obe, uwasekela muli iwe elyo akubika na pa cipuna cakwe ukuba imfumu iyakulabombela Yawe Lesa obe. Elyo pa mulandu wafyo Lesa atemwa abena Israeli no bufwayo bwakwe ubwakubasunga pe, eco akubikile ukuba imfumu pali bena, pakubaputwila imilandu yabo bwino kabili mu bulungami.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo apeela imfumu amatalanta umwanda umo na makumi yabili (120) aya golide",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "amatalanta 120:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila amakilo amakana yane (4,000) aya golide.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", ifya cena cisuma ifingi nganshi elyo no tumabwe utwauma umutengo. Takwatala akuba ifya cena cisuma ifingalingana nefyo namfumu wa ku Sheba apeele imfumu Solomoni.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu bakwa Hiramu elyo na bantu bakwa Solomoni ebasendele golide ukufuma ku Ofiri. Kabili ebaletele ne milando ya cimuti ca aligumi elyo no tumabwe utwauma umutengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imfumu yabomfya imilando ya aligumi pakupanga amatabo ya ku ŋanda yakwa Yawe na ku ŋanda ye sano. Kabili afibomfya mukupangilako amaseese ne nsango ifya bakemba wa nyimbo. Kabili takwatalile akuba ifyaba ngefi mu calo ca bena Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imfumu Solomoni epakupeela namfumu wa ku Sheba fyonse ifyo afwaile kabili ifyo alombele. Kanshi ena epakumupeela ifintu ifingi ukucila na pafyo aletele. Elyo namfumu wa ku Sheba pamo na babomfi bakwe baima babwelelamo ku calo kumwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Golide yonse iyo Solomoni alepoka cila mwaka yalefika amatalanta imyanda mutanda na makumi mutanda na mutanda (666),",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:13",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "amatalanta 666:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila amakilo amakana amakumi yabili na yatatu (23,000) aya golide.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukukanalundapo uwa mu misonko uwalesonka bakashitisha elyo na bamakwebo. Kabili imfumu shonse isha ku Arabia elyo na balashi ba mu calo balaleta golide na silifa kuli Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elyo imfumu Solomoni apanga inkwela imyanda ibili (200) ishikalamba kuli golide uwakufula. Cila nkwela afulilako golide uwafina amakilo yatatu na citika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili apanga inkwela ishinono imyanda itatu (300) kuli golide uwakufula. Pali cila nkwela afulilapo golide uwafina kilo umo na citika. Imfumu epakuya bika ishi nkwela mu muputule wa mwisano uo baleita ukuti “Umutengo wa ku Lebanoni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili imfumu yapanga icipuna ca lulumbi ku meno ya nsofu elyo yalambatikako golide wine wine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ici icipuna cakwete amatabo mutanda elyo cakwete ne cakunyantapo ica golide. Ku mbali shonse isha cipuna kwali ifyakutuushapo amaboko, ne nkalamo naiminina kuli cila lubali. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inkalamo shimbi ikumi limo na shibili (12) shaiminina pa matabo yonse mutanda, pali cila mpela ye tabo paiminina imo. Kabili takwatalile akupangwa icipuna ngeci mu bufumu ubuli bonse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ifipe fyonse ifyakunwenamo ifya mfumu Solomoni fyali ifya golide elyo ne fipe fyonse ifya mu ŋanda ye sano iyo baleita ukuti “Umutengo wa ku Lebanoni” fyali fya golide wine wine. Tamwali icapangilwe kuli silifa pantu silifa tayali iyacindama mu nshiku shakwa Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imfumu yakwete amato aya ku Tashishi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila ku calo ca Sipeni. Aya mato yali yakulu pantu yalesendamo ifipe ifingi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ayengi umwalebomba abantu bakwa Hiramu. Umuku umo pa myaka itatu aya mato yalebwela nayasenda golide, silifa, ameno ya nsofu, bakolwe bakalamba elyo na bapikoko",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9:21",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Bapikoko:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ba Baibele bamo batile, “bakolwe wa mpili.”",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.21"
            ]
