          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imfumu Solomoni yacilile imfumu shonse isha pano isonde ubunonshi na mano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili shonse imfumu sha pano isonde shalefwaisha ukumonana na Solomoni kukumfwako amano Lesa abikile mu mutima wakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Panuma ya cila mwaka, onse uwaisako aleleta icabupe. Bamo baleleta ifipe ifya silifa, golide, imingila, ifyanso fya bulwi, ifinyamuti ifyanunka ubusaka muri pamo na fimbi ifya cena cisuma, bakabalwe elyo ne mfalashi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
