          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lelo pa milandu imbi iya pa bufumu bwakwa Solomoni ukufumafye pa kutendeka mpaka na ku mpela, bushe tafyalembwa mu mashiwi yakwa Natani kasesema, mu busesemo bwakwa Ahiya umwina Shiloni elyo na mu fimonwa fyakwa Ido uwamwene palwakwa Yeroboamu umwana wakwa Nebati? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni aikele mu Yerusalemu no kuteeka icalo conse ica Israeli pa myaka amakumi yane (40). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 9:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilyo afwile, bamushiikile ku ncende ukwalala ifikolwe fyakwe mu musumba wakwa Davidi wishi. Elyo umwana wakwe umwaume Reoboamu ewamupyene pa bufumu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.9.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.9.31"
            ]
          }
        }
